  "content": "\n\n<blockquote>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1244599/description_3cea142d-5621-4717-8174-7961c82957d7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"513\"><br>歡迎來到我的模組擴充包 <strong>Sandwich Delight！</strong> 這是為 <strong>Farmer's Delight</strong> 設計的擴充模組。由於 Farmer's Delight 原本只有三種三明治，本模組新增了更多種類的三明治。</p>\n<p>目前模組內已收錄超過 25 種三明治。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>🔨 </strong><strong>必要相依模組：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/farmers-delight\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Farmer's Delight</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>➕ 相容性：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/appleskin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>AppleSkin</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/crate-delight-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Crate Delight</a></strong></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Create</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Diet</strong></a></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight:bold\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>JEI</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>我可以將此模組用於整合包（Modpack）中嗎？</strong></p>\n<p>可以，但請務必標明我的作者資訊（Credit）。</p>",
